        "text": "Guys, I’m sharing an early demo that can help validate our initial hypothesis and support pilot efforts.\nThe first user flow looks like this:\n1. Create a new category\n2. Initiate support\n3. Support gets stored\n4. Redirect to the dashboard\nFrom there, you should be able to track engagement and the leading passive metrics tied to it.\nPlease try the flow yourselves and focus on the following:\n• Do the actions I’m triggering on the data make sense?\n• Does the data feel trustworthy and provide the right context?\n• Is anything missing that you would want to add or remove?\n• Is the experience intuitive?\n• Are the tooltips clear?\nRaise any concerns or feedback as you go.",
